  "integration_notes": "Di-vendor penuh di replica-skill/ (MIT). Terdaftar di pipeline agregasi setup.sh sehingga 11 sub-skill masuk unified index secara otomatis. Jalur pipeline: recon -> architect -> design -> build -> backend -> test -> diff -> entrepreneur -> brand -> launch -> deploy. Enforce clean-room: tidak menyalin kode/asets; sweep.py memblokir deploy selama masih ada nama/domain/warna original.",
